1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:05,283
Two fathers and two sons go fishing. Together they catch exactly three fish.

2
00:00:05,583 --> 00:00:09,305
Each of them takes home one whole fish. How is that possible?

3
00:00:09,605 --> 00:00:12,962
How does everyone get one fish? You have 10 seconds. Think!

4
00:00:21,762 --> 00:00:23,175
There are only three people!

5
00:00:23,475 --> 00:00:29,175
A grandfather, his son, and his grandson. The dad in the middle is both a father and a son.

6
00:00:29,475 --> 00:00:32,561
Did you get it right? Follow for a new riddle every day!
